{"text": " What is crypto? Monkeys use leaves to buy things. Leaves used by most monkeys as currency. But there are some downsides to leaves. Leaves controlled by monkey banks. Every time monkeys buy something with leaves, monkey banks take a bit extra. Buying things with leaves often takes long time for monkey banks to process, especially if monkeys send leaves to other monkey countries. How does crypto work? Monkey banks can print more leaves, which can cause inflation. Not every monkey has access to monkey bank. Leaves can be faked. Monkey bank isn't always open. So monkeys invent new currency. Monkeys use bananas. How does crypto work? Bananas are not controlled by one monkey or monkey bank. Bananas are controlled by entire troop. Every time monkey buys something with banana, there are usually no fees. Or maybe just a very small fee. Unless it's particularly busy. Buying things with bananas is very quick. Even internationally. Every monkey can do it without having to go to monkey banks. Some bananas have limited supply, which means no inflation. Bananas can't be faked. Monkeys can also trade bananas 24-7.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 1.6400000000000001, "text": " What is crypto?", "tokens": [50363, 1867, 318, 21473, 30, 50445], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20654861214234657, "compression_ratio": 1.7924528301886793, "no_speech_prob": 0.005606822669506073}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 1.6400000000000001, "end": 5.04, "text": " Monkeys use leaves to buy things.", "tokens": [50445, 2892, 13083, 779, 5667, 284, 2822, 1243, 13, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20654861214234657, "compression_ratio": 1.7924528301886793, "no_speech_prob": 0.005606822669506073}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 5.04, "end": 8.24, "text": " Leaves used by most monkeys as currency.", "tokens": [50615, 46597, 973, 416, 749, 26697, 355, 7395, 13, 50775], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20654861214234657, "compression_ratio": 1.7924528301